The explicit Hamiltonians listed in this appendix are obtained from the classification and computations in \cite{Chi4}, where detailed analysis of weights and Kovalevskaya exponents for Painlev\'e-type systems are provided.

When $n=2$, regular weights satisfying (W1) to (W3) are only:
\begin{eqnarray*}
(a_1, a_2, b_2, b_1 ; h) &=& (2,3,4,5; 8), \\
