\section{Conclusion} In this research paper, the authors have made an effort to discover novel probability SK operators and have derived the fundamental theorem of approximation. Analogously, a deep comparative study is established between the classical and probabilistic SK operators not only in the form of numerical data but also in the key features of an image in which the classical results are better than the probabilistic results. In contrast, the PSK- sampling operators provide better results as compared to SK-operators when dealing with the noise or randomness. More preciously, if the variance is low, the probabilistic operators yield stable results, which implies that the probabilistic SK-operators yield stable results.
