I & X &  -\alpha X(\tilde{\Phi}_{12}+A_s  \tilde{\Phi}_{22}+B_s   \tilde{\Phi}_{23}^\top) & -\alpha X(\tilde{\Phi}_{13}+A_s  \tilde{\Phi}_{23}+B_s \tilde{\Phi}_{33})  &  \alpha X \Xi  \\
\star & \star &   -\alpha  \tilde{\Phi}_{22} & -\alpha  \tilde{\Phi}_{23} & 0 \\
