\section{CONCLUSIONS}
In this paper we presented a dynamic output-feedback controller synthesis method for dissipativity based on noisy input-state data  for discrete-time LTI systems, which is a useful non-trivial generalization of existing static state-feedback controller
synthesis methods based on input-state data.
