the Mayer-Vietoris exact sequence for $\Sigma_d(F)$ yields
$$  0 \to \overbrace{H_2(\widetilde{F} \times S^1)}^{\cong \Lambda_0^{2g}} \to H_2(X_F^d) \to H_2(\Sigma_d(F)) \xrightarrow{} \Lambda_0  \to 0.$$
