=-\sum _{j=0}^n
   \frac{i (-1)^j \pi  \binom{n}{j} }{(b+j) v n!}\\ \times
\left(c^{-\frac{1+m}{v}} (b+j)^{\frac{1+m}{v}} \left(-i \csc \left(\frac{(1+m) \pi
   }{v}\right) \log \left(\frac{2 i \pi }{v}\right)\right.\right. \\ \left.\left.
+2 e^{\frac{i (1+m) \pi }{v}}
