Let $A=(a_{ij})$ be the $2 \times (n-2)$ matrix obtained by deleting the last row from $B(\varphi'')$. Define the $S$-ideal 
\begin{align*}
\mathcal{K}=(l_1,\dots,l_{n-2}) + I_{2}(A) + (zw_0).    
