\section{Complete and Rigorous Proofs for the Policy‑Gap Bound (Theorem~\ref{thm:policy_gap_formal})}
\label{app:math_foundation_publishable}

This appendix provides the complete, self‑contained analytic backbone for Theorem~\ref{thm:policy_gap_formal}. All proof sketches have been expanded into detailed arguments, with explicit reliance on parabolic maximal‑regularity and monotone‑operator theory.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
% TABLE OF SYMBOLS를 가장 앞으로 이동
\subsection{Table of Symbols}
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{cc}
\toprule
Symbol & Meaning \\ \midrule
$E_v,E_h,E_f$ & Gradient / coefficient / source errors \\
$\varepsilon$ & FOC residual norm \\
$\delta_{\mathrm{BPTT}}$ & Costate estimation error (Def.~\ref{def:bptt_error_publishable})\\
$\underline\Lambda$ & Lower eigenvalue from Lemma~\ref{lem:strong_concavity}\\
$C_S,C_v''$ & PDE stability / coupled‑error constants \\
$L_F, C_{\text{tot}}$ & Final error amplification constants \\
