        \mel**{\m{i}{L},\m{i+1}{L}}{ }{\m{i}{L+1},\m{i+1}{L+1}}
        }
        ,
\end{align}
for $\oper{o}$ the $(2\mmax+1)^2$-dimensional operator version of $\oper{O}$ for the bond between any two rotors. 
