\begin{abstract}
We prove gauge equivalence between integrable field generalization of the elliptic Calogero-Moser model
and the higher rank XYZ Landau-Lifshitz model of vector type on 1+1 dimensional space-time.
Explicit formulae for the change of variables are derived, thus providing the Poisson map
between these models.
\end{abstract}



