We design our experiment in such as way because we are thinking of this forecasting methodology in the context of quantitative trading as opposed to risk premiums as described by Ciamac Moallemi in Macro Hive podcast at 9 minute mark, where quantitative trading is focused on trading conditional views that are dynamically trading, where risk premium may be thought of as a long term view that has to bear out over time.
