  \caption{
  Metallicity distribution function (MDF) of stars in satellite galaxies with $\Mstel > 10^9 \Msun$, for fiducial simulations (red) and weak SN feedback simulations (blue). Downward arrows indicate the median stellar metallicity values of stars in satellite galaxies in each model. } 
