as mirrors to the Milnor fibres of the three simple elliptic singularities.
In this work, a slightly different construction of $F \colon S \to \mathbb{P}^1$ is given. 
The result in \cite{KeatingCusp} is the categorical enhancement of the duality between $X$ and a mirror Laurent polynomial. 
\end{remark}




